<p>You use your demon seeds to the fullest of their potential.</p><p>Each time you enter combat you automatically summon a random demon from your worn seeds for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 5, 6, 8, 8</acronym> turns. Demons are only summoned if their life is over 70% and only if not other summoned demon is from Doom Concordat.</p><p>Each time you kill a creature a random worn demon seed with less than 100% life will be healed for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2%, 4%, 6%, 8%, 10%</acronym> life and resurrected if it was dead and the target was an elite or more.</p><p>In addition you feed of the arrival, departure or death of your demons, each time healing yourself for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">104, 135, 159, 180, 198</acronym> life.</p><p>The healing is based on your Spellpower.</p>